###
# Beadhive / beads / bv
# The bead corpus lives on the dolt remote (refs/dolt/data), so the whole
# .beads/ tree is machine-local — that also covers proxieddb/ and the
# issues.jsonl export that bv reads.
###
.beads/
.dolt/
.beads-credential-key
*.db
# bv (beads viewer) local config and caches
.bv/

###
# Repowise codebase index
###
.repowise/

# Beadhive gate lock — transient, written per-session. Untracked, it makes the
# working tree dirty, which `bh hive sync` treats as unsafe-to-sync and skips.
/.beads.gate.lock

# Codex agent state (sibling of .claude/, machine-local)
/.codex/
